m]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_named_pomodoro.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/capture_named_pomodoro.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-1t[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-1t/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pomodoro ledger scanner and `bob capture-pomodoros`[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro_ledger[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro_ledger: add the shared named-Pomodoro scanner (name, slug, time[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]range, current, stale-safe ref, selection) and the read-only discovery [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command that exposes it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`@route:id#pomodoro` grammar and capture execution[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture_named_marker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro_ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture_named_marker: extend the capture grammar with the third [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro-name component, route it through capture execution's Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selection, and report it in capture-parse spans, needs, and diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`bob capture-pomodoro-name` write command[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro_name_command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro_ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro_name_command: add the single-purpose command that canonicalizes[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a name and appends it to one open, unnamed Pomodoro through an atomic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`capture-complete` Pomodoro-name context[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]complete_pomodoro_name[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro_ledger, capture_named_marker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]complete_pomodoro_name: return ranked pomodoro_name candidates, collapse[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate slugs, and always offer never-filtered nameable rows for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unnamed Pomodoros.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture Pomodoro-name completion and naming prompt[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_pomodoro_name_ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro_name_command, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]complete_pomodoro_name[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_pomodoro_name_ui: decode the additive candidate fields, render the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro completion rows, and add the inline naming prompt that writes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the name before splicing the slug.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1t","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1t.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b292e03d0511504b140399a7f2e605e0","started_at":"2026-08-28T16:38:03.433606+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"7bacd63892fab7668bcc6ebf3d1402a5c9646e9c173e00f4525e1713995b952d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1t.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"173825893e198340f47facc33deb698ee9c6064854248661c2e49c50d8f999e7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1t.land/meta.json","size_bytes":635},"prompt":{"digest":"7daba41004fb3988f500e32135b1aae058e95b28c1ce21b6ca9cdb2f13c125c6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1t.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":292},"state":{"dige